%% Title: Collection cycle · part 2 of 3 · fetch, normalise, store, score
%% Summary: What one open route of a claimed source does: the guarded HTTP fetch, normalisation with redaction and the provenance fingerprint, storage, inline scoring with audit rows, and the run record.
%% Sources: src/collectors/{index,base,http,netguard,transport,robots,normalize,identity,provenance,errors,redact,state,cycle,runner}.js, src/pipeline/{ingest,sentiment,relevance,discourse}.js. Spec: TECHNICAL_SPEC.md section 8 (PII handling, provenance); ADR 0001 (terms and politeness, D2).
flowchart LR

  subgraph FETCH["Fetch · one collector per open route"]
    direction TB
    F1["13 · buildCollectors(): one instance per open route;<br/>the constructor throws GateClosedError<br/>if route.requires is missing"]:::done
    F2["14 · HttpClient checks every hop before sending it:<br/>https only, public host, route allowedHosts (SSRF guard),<br/>DNS answers checked and pinned;<br/>robots.txt for publisher RSS routes (conservative);<br/>redirects followed manually, max 4;<br/>a credentialed request never crosses origins"]:::done
    F3["15 · User-Agent PulseOfAI/#lt;version#gt; (+contact URL);<br/>per-host spacing; 20 s timeout;<br/>2 retries on 429 / 5xx honouring Retry-After;<br/>ETag / Last-Modified → 304 not modified"]:::done
    F4["16 · caps: 5 MB decoded per response (route override),<br/>robots.txt 500 KiB, bulk file 50 MB;<br/>a DTD with entity declarations is refused"]:::done
    F5{"401 / 403 / 451, bot<br/>challenge or robots<br/>disallow?"}:::done
    F1 --> F2 --> F3 --> F4 --> F5
  end

  subgraph NORM["Normalise · base.js collect() → toPayload()"]
    direction TB
    N1["17 · raw text capped, HTML to text (linear),<br/>identity redaction, ingest@1.5.0: e-mails, @handles,<br/>Reddit u/ names, phones, profile links, cc names,<br/>sign-offs, Wikipedia unsigned notes"]:::done
    N2["18 · allowlisted payload: title, text, link unless an<br/>identity link, published_at, language, city-level<br/>location (basis content or publisher), licence,<br/>attribution; an identity-bearing upstream id is<br/>stored only as route:fp:HMAC"]:::done
    N3["19 · provenance_fingerprint = HMAC-SHA256(<br/>PROVENANCE_KEY or AUDIT_HASH_KEY,<br/>slug : upstream id : source URL)"]:::done
    N4["20 · drop items older than maxAgeDays (default 7);<br/>AI scope filter on scope 'filter' routes;<br/>dedupe within the batch"]:::done
    N1 --> N2 --> N3 --> N4
  end

  subgraph STORE["Store and score · pipeline/ingest.js"]
    direction TB
    T1["21 · storeRawPost(): strip NUL, drop PII_FIELDS,<br/>SHA-256 content hash, dedupe on<br/>(source_id, external_id), insert raw_posts<br/>with provenance_fingerprint and ingest_mv_id"]:::done
    T2{"new post?"}:::done
    T3["22 · join the cycle job: cycle.currentCycleJob()<br/>advisory lock; the running cron job of this<br/>window or a new one; inflight_runs + 1"]:::done
    T4["23 · scorePost(): sentiment, relevance, discourse;<br/>each writes its *_results row and one<br/>decision_audit_log row (current methodology)"]:::done
    T5["scoring failed → reserveRetry + ingest job;<br/>enqueue failed → run error, the 24 h<br/>unscored sweep re-queues the post"]:::done
    T6["store failed → restore the route's cursor<br/>and HTTP validators, run error"]:::done
    T1 --> T2
    T2 -- yes --> T3 --> T4
  end

  subgraph RECORD["Record the run · state.js, runner.js"]
    direction TB
    V1["24 · classify errors: error_kind + http_status only;<br/>error text scrubbed of every secret (redact.js)"]:::done
    V2["25 · saveOutcome() on source_collection_state:<br/>cursor, HTTP validators, last success / error,<br/>consecutive_failures"]:::done
    V3["26 · refused → recordRefusal(): refused_until,<br/>refusal_count + 1, one critical source_refused<br/>alert; a successful probe clears it;<br/>then unchanged run → unchanged_runs + 1,<br/>else one source_runs row"]:::done
    V4["27 · embed gate: relevance ≥ 1/20 (one lexicon<br/>match) → one embed job per new post"]:::done
    V5["28 · leaveCycle(): counts added, inflight_runs − 1<br/>(always, in finally) → part 3"]:::done
    V1 --> V2 --> V3 --> V4 --> V5
  end

  W1["collect stores and hands scoring<br/>to the ingest queue (new topology)"]:::wip

  subgraph LEGEND["Status legend"]
    L1["done: on master or ships in this PR"]:::done
    L2["wip: PR #10 Part 2, in flight"]:::wip
  end

  F5 -- yes --> V1
  F5 -- no --> N1
  N4 --> T1
  T1 -. "insert error" .-> T6 --> V1
  T2 -- "no, duplicate" --> V1
  T4 -. "error" .-> T5 --> V1
  T4 --> V1
  T4 -.-> W1

